  "historyNote": "#6905, eff 12-4-98, EXPIRED: 12-4-06 New. #8810, INTERIM, eff 1-25-07, EXPIRED: 7-25-07 New. #9051, eff 12-27-07; ss by #10746, eff 1-1-15; ss by #14188, eff 4-5-25 (formerly Ac 501.03)",
